      "value": "@{628d00a6b624bb0b622328ef|full_name} I've seen this happen while I was on the persistence closed beta as well as the current persistence beta. In some cases my friend wasn't on the same beta, and the world was not a persistence enabled world. In other cases we had both been on the persistence beta and the world had been persistence enabled. I believe I've also seen the bug affect only one other player, similar to the gaslighting bug, but more extreme, where I was unable to see a single player or their udon networking until one of us rejoined, but other players in the instance were fine.",
